# r13 head at full-body scale (3/4, facing screen-LEFT). Pixel artist 3. Hand-authored grid. (round-1 fixes)
# Landmarks as head_front: crown y5, bang cut y14 (notches x9,x17), brow y15, lash y18, iris y19-23, lower lash y24,
# blush y25-26, nose y25, mouth y27-28, chin y31. Far eye x11-14 (narrow), bridge gap x15-16, near eye x17-21 (+flick x22).
# Canvas 44 (turnaround x = x+26). Skull back edge x33 (y8-28). Knot 3x6 x33-35 y8-13; near-loop teardrop x34-42 y4-16; far loop hidden.
size: 44 40
legend:
. = transparent
K = #241628 outline
P = #4A2448 plum_0
d = #6E3C3A hair_1
m = #A85A3A hair_2
l = #D08658 hair_hi
s = #FCD6B4 skin_2
t = #F6BCA6 skin_mid
u = #EBA586 skin_1
v = #D07C74 skin_0
L = #B0606A line_skin
i = #153E4E iris_0
j = #2C9696 iris_1
k = #86DCC6 iris_2
W = #FFFFFF snow_3
n = #DFEAF6 snow_2
b = #1C4C54 teal_0
c = #2A8C8E teal_1
e = #6ACBB6 teal_2
r = #8E2C4A crn_1
z = #BA4A58 crn_2
x = #F06A58 red_2
w = #A8C0E0 snow_1 tear/sweat
R = #DC3A40 red_1 FX
